    <string name="guia10_ativo">Pro is active: the network is yours for good, on every TV with your Google account.</string>
    <string name="guia10_permissao">" When you continue, the app asks for access to the TV’s files — that’s what lets it show and organize them."</string>
    <string name="guia10_x">The first %1$d days come with everything unlocked. After that, the TV’s files stay free forever, and the network becomes Pro: a one-time purchase, no subscription, valid on every TV with your Google account.</string>
    <string name="guia10_x_preco">The first %1$d days come with everything unlocked. After that, the TV’s files stay free forever, and the network becomes Pro: a one-time purchase of %2$s, no subscription, valid on every TV with your Google account.</string>
    <string name="guia1_t">Welcome to LibertyX Folder</string>
    <string name="guia1_x">The files on your TV and on your computer, opened and organized with the remote. This guide shows every tool — it takes a minute.</string>
    <string name="guia2_t">The remote</string>
    <string name="guia2_x">The gold highlight shows where you are. You’ll see it all over the app — just follow it.</string>
    <string name="guia3_t">The home screen</string>
    <string name="guia3_x">Everything starts here: search across the whole device, ready-made categories (images, videos, audio, documents, downloads, installers and archives), TV and USB drive storage, and the network.</string>
    <string name="guia4_t">Folders</string>
    <string name="guia4_x">List or grid, as you like. The trail at the top takes you back to any folder along the path in one step. Under ⋮ More: new folder, sort by name, date, size or type, show hidden files and refresh.</string>
    <string name="guia5_t">Select and act</string>
    <string name="guia5_x">Hold OK on a file to start selecting; after that, OK marks others. The bottom bar moves, copies, shares and deletes — and under More you’ll find rename, open with another app and details.</string>
    <string name="guia6_t">Copy and move</string>
    <string name="guia6_x">Chose Move or Copy? Open the destination folder — on the TV, the USB drive or a computer on the network — and confirm. Progress shows at the bottom and goes away by itself when it’s done. Nothing is overwritten: a duplicate becomes \"name (1)\".</string>
    <string name="guia7_t">The network</string>
    <string name="guia7_x">When it opens, the app finds the computers, NAS and routers with a disk in your home by itself. Pick one and sign in with a user name and password — or as a guest, if the folder is open. Servers stay saved on the home screen.</string>
    <string name="guia8_t">Watch without downloading</string>
    <string name="guia8_x">Videos, music and photos on the server open straight in the app you choose — LibertyX Player, for example — read piece by piece, with no waiting for a download. Fast-forward and rewind work just like with a file on the TV.</string>
    <string name="guia9_t">Search</string>
    <string name="guia9_x">On the home screen, search covers the whole device. Inside a folder, the magnifier filters what’s on screen — and the arrow next to it also searches every subfolder, even on a network server.</string>
